---
Show synth editor panel on startup.

The synth editor should be visible by default when the application
launches, not hidden until a synth track is clicked.

## Acceptance Criteria
- [ ] Synth editor panel visible on first frame after startup
- [ ] Correct synth parameters shown for the auto-selected track
- [ ] Mode selector (Sub/FM/WT) functional immediately

## Test Plan
- [ ] Launch app, verify synth editor visible
- [ ] Verify synth controls are interactive immediately
- [ ] Verify mode selector works on first click
